      126.24,
      361.68,
      300.01,
      383.75
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.:MUL/LND/2/ACQ/47.Land Ministry Ref. No. :4-3/15/2014/VE/236.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      397.68,
      309.97,
      455.75
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land/servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      469.68,
      222.88,
      479.75
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      497.28,
      309.94,
      567.35
    ],
    "text": "Under mentioned allotments of land shown in the SurveyorGenerals plan of F.V.P. 83, supplement No. 16, sheet No. 12Prepared by Matara Surveyor General, situated in the villageof Pandithaporuwa, Deiyandara Grama Niladhari Division,Mulatiyana Divisional Secretarys Division in Matara DistrictSouthern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      581.28,
      309.91,
      651.35
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 106Name of Land: Kongahahenawatta; Description: Garden,28 Coconut trees (about 20-40 years of age) and Tea plantation(about 10 years of age) and mixed crops can be seen; Claimant:Government; (Original Claimant: Prema Weerabaddana,Kongahahena, Deiyandara); Extent: 0.1576 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      738.69,
      171.03,
      746.6
    ],
    "text": "1A - G 26876 - 87 (2017/09)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.912472248077393
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      318.48,
      561.77,
      388.55
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 229Name of Land: Kongahahenawatta; Description: Garden,15 Coconut trees, (about 20-40 years of age) and banana andmixed crops can be seen; Claimant: Government; (OriginalClaimant: Prema Weerabaddana, Kongahahena, Deiyandara);Extent: 0.0882 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      402.48,
      561.97,
      520.55
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorised in writing, beforeme at Divisional Secretariat, Mulatiyana on the 29.03.2018 at10.00 a.m. o'clock and are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting [in duplicate] on or before the 22.03.2018, the natureof their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcomputation for the said land/servitude, the amount ofcompensation and the details of the computation of suchamount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
